  "notes": "Two boom versions exist: T3 (16.7-54 m, 1 base + 3 telescopic sections, chart p.31) and T5 (17.4-80 m, 1 base + 5 telescopic sections, chart p.83); T5 is stored. The 700 t rating is over the rear only (17.4 m, 3 m); '*' sub-column excluded; 360° max 239.3 t. 14 T5 boom lengths in source; omitted 77 m and 79 m. IMPORTANT: this is a 'maxtab' envelope - cell shading marks whether 155 t (6.4/7.4/8.4 m radius) or 175 t (grey, 6.4/7.4 m) counterweight is required; counterweight_t=175 is the maximum, not per cell. Check source. Outrigger span from p.5: longitudinal 10571 mm (6042+4529; other side 10531), transverse 9578 mm. Max supporting force 2380 kN (243 t) p.9 (other 1860 kN/190 t, 1120 kN/115 t). operatingWeight_t = on-road <=96 t (8 x 12 t) (p.12). Max hook height not stated numerically for T boom. Hook block weight is part of the load. Boom lengths omitted from source table: 77, 79 m."
